// Every program of the tests' inputs and of examples says the same on one
// thread as with every loop that can on many (test/parallel_same.py):
// what ent promises however a program is run, checked for all of them at
// once. Each is built both ways and run both ways; one that needs C of its
// own or opens a window is left out.
// RUN: %python %S/../parallel_same.py %ent -- %t %S/Inputs/*.ent %S/../../examples/*.ent | FileCheck %s
// CHECK-NOT: FAIL
// CHECK: same: {{[0-9]+}}
